2205-  policy: `trusted-asserter` over the own principal plus `:trusted`, or a
2206-  composed `:verify` over a static `:decision` or a capacity-1
2207-  `:decision-medium`. `round` serves it (7.5.6, step 3).
2208-- **External.** `:admission :external` mints the admission pair and runs
2209-  no interpreter in process. Another process reads the questions and
2210-  appends the answers over any `dao.stream` exposure of the pair. There
2211-  is no privileged node: the external interpreter is a peer of the
2212-  medium like any other.
2213-- **ShiBi.** A ShiBi interpreter attaches as either: a verify function
2214-  over its own published snapshot, in process, or an external reader of
2215-  the questions.
2216-
